{"asset_key":"timeline/dialoguetree_story_10102070","episode":"timeline","category":"dialoguetree_story","story_id":"10102070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1010207001:0":{"text":"ここまで来れば問題ないでしょう！皆さん、大丈夫ですか？","source_cn":"到这里就没问题了！各位，你们都还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83A7C4E81EA4AD69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010207002:0":{"text":"な、なんとか……でも頭がクラクラして……それに……","source_cn":"还、还好……就是晕得慌……还有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC08194F406EB84A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010207003:0":{"text":"オロロロロ……！","source_cn":"——呕……！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x724086224357DF72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010207004:0":{"text":"きゃあああ！私のスカートに吐かないでよ！！","source_cn":"呀——！你别吐在我的裙子上！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83EA71EB8431066D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010207005:0":{"text":"よかった、吐くだけで済んで……","source_cn":"太好了……只是呕吐而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44CC2584715FBA20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010207006:0":{"text":"「吐くだけで」？","source_cn":"“只是呕吐而已”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12BBF18C59F5A6B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010207007:0":{"text":"親愛なるメイジのお嬢さん……まさかこれよりも酷い状況をご存じで？","source_cn":"我说尊敬的魔法师小姐……难道你还见过更糟糕的情况？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25A93C6ABDEDE3FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010207008:0":{"text":"実は……私、テレポート魔法が苦手で。","source_cn":"其实……我不太擅长传送魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3910E353BBC461F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010207009:0":{"text":"テレポート魔法は方位を正確に把握する必要があるのですが、私は方向音痴なので……時々ミスをしてしまうんです。","source_cn":"传送魔法需要精准把控方位，但我不太认路……所以偶尔会出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85A7AB278480AC75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010207010:0":{"text":"あの……失礼ですが、そのミスってまさか頭と胴体が分離するとかじゃ……？","source_cn":"那个……冒昧问一句，你说的小差错该不会是指整个人失踪吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7713BC3A1BCA1A57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1010207011:0":{"text":"そこまで酷くありませんよ！","source_cn":"怎么会呢？没那么严重。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0784830E8BC7E70F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1010207012:0":{"text":"何度も検証しましたが、せいぜい四肢や内蔵の一部を失うだけです。すぐに対処すればちゃんと元に戻ります。","source_cn":"我反复验证过，最多会丢失身体的某些小部件。只要及时处理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC2ED75A23FE4E33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1010207013:0":{"text":"そういうことはもっと早く言ってくださいよ！","source_cn":"这种事下次要提前说啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDED6A68AF0F9D623","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1010207014:0":{"text":"次がないことを祈るよ。","source_cn":"最好别有下次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x281D401B79980213","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1010207015:0":{"text":"マスターならきっと、テレポート魔法の副作用を治す方法をご存じですよね？","source_cn":"主人！你一定有办法治疗传送魔法带来的副作用，对不对？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x12845B2B647FF5FA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスターならきっと、テレポート魔法の副作用を治す方法をご存じですよね？","female":"マスターならきっと、テレポート魔法の副作用を治す方法をご存じですよね？","variant_male_record_index":"96569","variant_female_record_index":"96570","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1010207015":{"text":"マスターならきっと、テレポート魔法の副作用を治す方法をご存じですよね？","source_cn":"主人！你一定有办法治疗传送魔法带来的副作用，对不对？","status":"